  "id": "section-883",
  "title": "关于军队要协同地方管工业的指示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-263.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>263)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　此件可印发军级会议各同志。军队不但要协同地方管农业，对工业也要管。沈阳军区派遣大批人员进厂做宣传和做调查的办法是很多的。××军在无锡、××军在重庆、××军在伊春、苇河等处也有好的经验。总之，军队不能坐视工业生产下降而置之不理。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-262.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-264.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
